52	 *
53	 * The work tree, and the shared workspace. The official server was given the work tree
54	 * alone, so `/tmp/atomaton-workspace` was reachable from the shell and from nothing
55	 * else — while the prompt template told every agent it was "an ordinary directory, on
56	 * the same filesystem, at the same path for every tool". That sentence is true now.
